WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:16.361
Emmy and Mom were planting flowers.

2
00:00:16.362 --> 00:00:21.822
"Sunday is a special day," said Mom.

3
00:00:21.823 --> 00:00:25.579
"I know," said Emmy.

4
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:35.417
"We don't have to go to school!"

5
00:00:35.418 --> 00:00:40.604
Dad and Harry were watching TV.

6
00:00:40.605 --> 00:00:47.136
"Sunday will be a very fun day," said Mom.

7
00:00:47.137 --> 00:00:50.654
"Yes!" said Harry.

8
00:00:50.655 --> 00:01:03.447
"There's a great baseball game on TV!"

9
00:01:03.448 --> 00:01:11.169
Oliver and Rover were playing outside.

10
00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.423
Mom tossed the ball to Rover too.

11
00:01:16.424 --> 00:01:21.372
"Do you know what Sunday is?" she asked Oliver.

12
00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:24.686
"Yep," said Oliver proudly.

13
00:01:24.687 --> 00:01:36.526
"Sunday is the day after Saturday!"

14
00:01:36.527 --> 00:01:41.629
Poor Mom! Sunday was Mother's Day.

15
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:50.471
But no one in the family remembered.

16
00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:57.424
On Sunday the kids woke up early.

17
00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:02.010
"Let's surprise Mom with breakfast," said Emmy.

18
00:02:02.011 --> 00:02:07.060
"She thinks we forgot about Mother's Day."

19
00:02:07.061 --> 00:02:13.255
Emmy and Dad made blueberry pancakes.

20
00:02:13.256 --> 00:02:16.519
Harry got the maple syrup.

21
00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:25.608
Oliver put some pretty flowers in a vase.

22
00:02:25.609 --> 00:02:31.022
Then they carried the tray upstairs.

23
00:02:31.023 --> 00:02:35.819
"Happy Mother's Day!" cried everyone.

24
00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:49.889
But Mom wasn't in her room!

25
00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.111
"I'm home!" called Mom.

26
00:02:55.112 --> 00:03:01.090
The kids and Dad ran downstairs.

27
00:03:01.091 --> 00:03:05.342
"Where were you?" asked Emmy.

28
00:03:05.343 --> 00:03:12.387
"I went out to buy some bagels," said Mom.

29
00:03:12.388 --> 00:03:16.188
"I wanted a special Mother's Day breakfast.

30
00:03:16.189 --> 00:03:27.547
And that is just what I got!"
